WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.379
I don't have any friends.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.338
See you!

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.548
I mean zero friends.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.508
Because I'm totally different
from other people.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.926
I'm an entirely different creature.

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:12.262
How could you make friends
in that situation?

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:13.972
In spite of that...

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.100
Hey, dude!
Let's go eat some ramen noodles.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.686
Come with me, Saiki.
I feel disturbance in the air.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.731
Two people are stalking me now.

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.817
It sucks. I have lived
trying not to draw attention.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.944
-Why are you following us?
-Should I change schools?

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.113
You wanna eat ramen noodles with us?

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.282
I never said I would.
Just go slurp them by yourself.

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.701
You're the one following us.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:37.537
We are going to investigate
the disturbance in the air.

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:38.830
Get lost!

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:40.749
I never said I would.
Just go feel it by yourself.

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:43.877
Huh? You get lost! We're gonna eat ramen!

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.379
Go eat by yourself! Let's go, Saiki!
I can feel it's getting worse.

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.548
-We're gonna eat ramen!
-We gotta settle it down!

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:49.841
I never said I would!

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:52.218
It looks like they're
going out of business soon.

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:54.596
Saiki, how come you're friends with him?

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.223
I'm telling you as your partner,
you should give it a second thought.

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:58.391
I'm not your partner.

00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:02.604
Dude, you should quit being his friend.
I'm telling ya as your BFF.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:06.608
I'm not your BFF. Why don't you guys
become friends with each other, then?

